{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4c956250-af4d-896a-a751-0d217932ef46",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T12:59:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Jorge Gomes. I need to get a copy of a death certificate, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. Was the person who passed away in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, in Newport. It is for, um, to settle the estate. I am the landlord of the, the person, and there are things to close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Just so I understand, you're handling the estate, or you're a landlord with a tenant who passed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...sorry, the line is bad. I am helping with the estate paperwork. The family asked me. I need one copy for the bank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I caught most of that. Sorry, the line's cutting out on my end too. You need one certified copy for the bank, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one copy. Certified. And what is the fee for it? How much I pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a fee per copy, and I don't want to read you the wrong number off the top of my head. I'll check the current amount and I can tell you when we get the request going. Do you know the date of death?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it was January the ninth. This year, twenty twenty-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "January ninth, got it. And the full name of the person?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[inaudible] ...I am sorry, can you say again? The weather today, the rain, maybe the signal is bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll go slow. I asked for the full name of the person who passed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. One moment please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, my toast is ready, the toaster just made the ding behind me. I was waiting for it. Okay. The name is Manuel Teixeira. T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A. Manuel Teixeira. Thank you. Now, for a certified copy I'll need to go over what ID you'll bring and how you want to receive it. Are you able to come in, or do you want it by mail?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:59:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By mail is better for me. I work, so it is hard to come in the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll send the application information to you. Can I have a mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:59:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, but first my phone, in case. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one five one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:59:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-one. Got it, Mr. Gomes. I'll get that going and call if I need anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:59:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. You are very patient."
    }
  ],
